{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function whenSyncAccepted(receipt): SyncAppliedReceipt;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/sync-receipt.ts#L32","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/sync-receipt.ts:32"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Internal"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The moment a receipt's sync transaction was accepted. Handler-facing writes\nand Collection readiness wait for this, not for visibility: a transaction held by a persisting\noptimistic transaction becomes visible only when that transaction settles,\nso a handler awaiting visibility would wait for itself. Core accepts at\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"commit()"},{"type":"text","value":". A receipt that carries no acceptance moment is treated as\naccepted only when it resolves."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Adapter infrastructure, not an application API."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"receipt","children":[{"type":"text","value":"receipt"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/SyncAppliedReceipt.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SyncAppliedReceipt"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/SyncAppliedReceipt.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SyncAppliedReceipt"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"receipt","text":"receipt","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction whenSyncAccepted(receipt): SyncAppliedReceipt;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/sync-receipt.ts:32](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/sync-receipt.ts#L32)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nThe moment a receipt's sync transaction was accepted. Handler-facing writes\nand Collection readiness wait for this, not for visibility: a transaction held by a persisting\noptimistic transaction becomes visible only when that transaction settles,\nso a handler awaiting visibility would wait for itself. Core accepts at\n`commit()`. A receipt that carries no acceptance moment is treated as\naccepted only when it resolves.\n\n Adapter infrastructure, not an application API.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### receipt\n\n[`SyncAppliedReceipt`](../type-aliases/SyncAppliedReceipt.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SyncAppliedReceipt`](../type-aliases/SyncAppliedReceipt.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: whenSyncAccepted\ntitle: whenSyncAccepted\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction whenSyncAccepted(receipt): SyncAppliedReceipt;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/sync-receipt.ts:32](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/sync-receipt.ts#L32)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nThe moment a receipt's sync transaction was accepted. Handler-facing writes\nand Collection readiness wait for this, not for visibility: a transaction held by a persisting\noptimistic transaction becomes visible only when that transaction settles,\nso a handler awaiting visibility would wait for itself. Core accepts at\n`commit()`. A receipt that carries no acceptance moment is treated as\naccepted only when it resolves.\n\n Adapter infrastructure, not an application API.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### receipt\n\n[`SyncAppliedReceipt`](../type-aliases/SyncAppliedReceipt.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SyncAppliedReceipt`](../type-aliases/SyncAppliedReceipt.md)\n"}
